":"multi | Marks +1"},{"qnum":10,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Consider a lag-lead compensator <em>G<sub>c</sub></em>(<em>s</em>) defined as</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/86a5e210a0112b9c96bd7ac9da13595c12bfd996.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>\n<div><span>Numerical answer type</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"0","high":"0"},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/19311b26b19e214f7b753ca3c1c27c648efc9e4b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/752931d242ba783e2f147a8e780e905f6a5f6e8c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"numerical | Marks +2"},{"qnum":11,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>The open loop transfer function of a unity negative feedback system is given by</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/94435405475c30487cf6d7ba509e2feba5310636.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>The centroid of asymptotes in the root locus plot is located at</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/d56b539719f3170bf73d3312d96cf3ff7b6d3710.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/7577a03167a70aec48bbd42c5de7e54d6f828169.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/6e4cbf99dad3ad2a122297dd441890969a65bf25.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p><img src=\"/media/e95ae9cf69990876c4cd65aca2238de8dacc6d31.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>In a root locus plot, all the asymptotes meet at a common point on the real axis known as centroid or centre of gravity which is given by,</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/016564008fbbbb6107dd275258f6a6183b455440.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"single | Marks +1 / -0.33"},{"qnum":12,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>The sensitivity of the system given in the following figure with respect to feedback path transfer function at 