quo;<em>K</em>&rsquo; are respectively</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/3ef5b2cf64e1814f6a4472dbc782750472dbf077.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div><p><em>a </em>= 5 and <em>K </em>= 10</p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div><p><em>a </em>= 4 and <em>K </em>= 6</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div><p><em>a </em>= 2 and <em>K </em>= 10</p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div><p><em>a </em>= 5 and <em>K </em>= 12</p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/73df3dcfe9471d7abee71eaaa0a81a2f858633a6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"single | Marks +2 / -0.66"}],"questionCount":33,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:09.132Z"}